return ['domain'=>'presspermit-pro','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yor','project-id-version'=>'PublishPress Permissions Pro 4.8.1','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-04-02T18:54:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01 19:50+0000','x-generator'=>'Weblate 2026.6.1','messages'=>['PublishPress Permissions Pro'=>'PublishPress Awọn aṣẹ Pro','https://publishpress.com/permissions'=>'https://publishpress.com/permissions','PublishPress Permissions allows you to enable or deny access to posts, pages, categories, tags and more.'=>'PublishPress Permissions n jẹ ki o le mu wọle tabi kọ wọle si awọn ifiweranṣẹ, awọn oju-iwe, awọn ẹka, awọn ami ati bẹbẹ lọ.','PublishPress'=>'PublishPress','https://publishpress.com/'=>'https://publishpress.com/','Should pages with privacy status "premium" require set_pages_premium and edit_premium_pages capabilities? If so, you can %1$sassign a status-specific Page Editor role%2$s or %3$sadd the capabilities directly to a role%4$s.'=>'Ṣe awọn oju-iwe pẹlu ipo ipamọ "premium" nilo set_pages_premium ati edit_premium_pages awọn agbara? Ti o ba jẹ bẹ, o le %1$syan ipa Ẹlẹda Oju-iwe pato si ipo%2$s tabi %3$sfi awọn agbara kun taara si ipa%4$s.','Note: Workflow sequence and branching for pre-publication is configured %son a separate screen%s'=>'Akiyesi: Ilana iṣẹ ati ṣiṣan fun iṣaaju-publikẹṣan ni a ti ṣeto %son iboju oriṣiriṣi%s','Additional settings provided by the %s module.'=>'Awọn eto afikun ti a pese nipasẹ %s module.','Note: If you deactive, re-entry of the license key will be required for re-activation.'=>'Akiyesi: Ti o ba mu silẹ, iwọ yoo nilo lati tun wọle si bọtini iwe-aṣẹ fun atunṣe-ṣiṣe.','If enabled, custom group membership is applied network-wide (though role assignments are still site-specific).'=>'Ti o ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ ẹgbẹ aṣa ni a lo jakejado nẹtiwọki (biotilejepe awọn atunto ipa ṣi wa ni pato aaye).','Can create network-wide permission groups'=>'Le ṣẹda awọn ẹgbẹ aṣẹ jakejado nẹtiwọki','If group editing is allowed, can also modify network group membership'=>'Ti a ba gba ṣiṣatunkọ ẹgbẹ laaye, le tun satunkọ awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ nẹtiwọki','This feature will control direct URL access to files in /uploads/ folder. By default, files are blocked if they are attached to a post which the user can\'t view.'=>'Iṣẹ yii yoo ṣakoso iraye taara si URL si awọn faili ninu folda /uploads/. Ni aiyipada, awọn faili ni a dènà ti wọn ba so mọ ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo ko le wo.','File Access on multisite installations will require the following rules to be inserted above the stock ms-files.php rules in the %1$smain .htaccess file%2$s:'=>'Iraye si faili lori awọn fifi sori multisite yoo nilo awọn ofin wọnyi lati wa ni fi kun loke awọn ofin ms-files.php ti o wa ni %1$smain .htaccess file%2$s:','But your .htaccess is missing or not writeable!'=>'Ṣugbọn .htaccess rẹ padanu tabi ko le kọ!','.htaccess needs to be updated to include these rules.'=>'A nilo lati ṣe imudojuiwọn .htaccess lati ni awọn ofin wọnyi.','.htaccess file has all required rules.'=>'Faili .htaccess ni gbogbo awọn ofin ti a beere.','These rules will not be inserted automatically.  You are responsible for editing .htaccess and later removing the rules if the functionality is no longer desired.'=>'Awọn ofin wọnyi kii yoo wa ni fi kun laifọwọyi. Iwọ ni iduro fun ṣiṣatunkọ .htaccess ati nigbamii yiyọ awọn ofin ti iṣẹ naa ko ba jẹ dandan mọ.','Note that an additional rule will need to be added with each new site. %1$sTo eliminate this requirement, research "WordPress remove ms-files".%2$s'=>'Akiyesi pe ofin afikun kan yoo nilo lati wa ni fi kun pẹlu ọkọọkan aaye tuntun. %1$sLati yọkuro ibeere yii, ṣe iwadi "WordPress yọ ms-files".%2$s','You will need to manually restore the .htacces file to default contents if anything goes wrong. Proceed?'=>'Iwọ yoo nilo lati tun fa .htaccess pada si awọn akoonu aiyipada ti ohunkohun ba lọ ni aṣiṣe. Ṣe o fẹ tẹsiwaju?','Update .htaccess now'=>'Ṣatunkọ .htaccess bayii','only for sites with protected files'=>'nkan fun awọn aaye pẹlu awọn faili ti a daabobo','for all sites'=>'fun gbogbo awọn aaye','NONE: remove Permissions rules'=>'KO SI: yọ awọn ofin Awọn anfani','Since the plugin is not network-activated, you will need to modify the .htaccess file manually, inserting a RewriteRule as shown above for each site which needs file filtering.'=>'Nitori pe afikun naa ko ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ ni nẹtiwọọki, o nilo lati ṣe atunṣe faili .htaccess ni ọwọ, fi RewriteRule kan si gẹgẹ bi a ti fihan loke fun gbogbo aaye ti o nilo iyanju faili.','This extends the File Access feature to files that are not attached to any post. This will not apply to user who have the edit_private_files or pp_list_all_files capability.'=>'Eyi n fa ẹya iwọle faili si awọn faili ti a ko so mọ eyikeyi ifiweranṣẹ. Eyi kii yoo kan si awọn olumulo ti o ni agbara edit_private_files tabi pp_list_all_files.','Make attached files unreadable to users who do not have the edit_private_files or pp_list_all_files capability.'=>'Ṣe awọn faili ti a so mọ ko le ka fun awọn olumulo ti ko ni agbara edit_private_files tabi pp_list_all_files.','Improve Media Library performance by disabling file filtering for thumbnails (size specified in Settings > Media).'=>'Mu iṣẹ Media Library dara pọ nipa didi iyanju faili fun awọn thumbnail (iwọn ti a ṣalaye ninu Eto > Media).','On some sites, an additional redirect is required to correctly deliver protected files. Leave this disabled for better performance if possible.'=>'Ninu diẹ ninu awọn aaye, atunṣe afikun ni a nilo lati fi awọn faili ti a daabobo ranṣẹ ni deede. Fi eyi silẹ ni pipa fun iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti o dara julọ ti o ba ṣeeṣe.','The File Access feature uses an %1$s.htaccess%2$s file located at %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Normally no action is needed, but clicking the button below will update the URL keys (at next site access) that protect the files.'=>'Ẹya Iwọle Faili nlo faili %1$s.htaccess%2$s ti o wa ni %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Ni deede, ko si igbese ti o nilo, ṣugbọn titẹ bọtini ti o wa ni isalẹ yoo ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn bọtini URL (ni wiwọle aaye atẹle) ti o daabobo awọn faili.','The File Access feature uses an %1$s.htaccess%2$s file located at %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Normally no action is needed, but clicking the button below will update the URL keys that protect the files.'=>'Ẹya Iwọle Faili nlo faili %1$s.htaccess%2$s ti o wa ni %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Ni deede, ko si igbese ti o nilo, ṣugbọn titẹ bọtini ti o wa ni isalẹ yoo ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn bọtini URL ti o daabobo awọn faili.','Best practice is to access the above url periodically (using your own cron service) to prevent long-term bookmarking of protected files.'=>'Iṣe ti o dara julọ ni lati wọle si URL loke ni igbakọọkan (nipa lilo iṣẹ cron ti ara rẹ) lati ṣe idiwọ itẹka igba pipẹ ti awọn faili ti a daabobo.','Supply a custom key which will enable a support url to regenerate file access keys.  Then execute the url regularly (using your own cron service) to prevent long-term bookmarking of protected files.'=>'Pese bọtini aṣa kan ti yoo jẹ ki URL atilẹyin kan tun ṣe awọn bọtini iwọle faili. Lẹhinna ṣe ṣiṣe URL naa ni igbagbogbo (nipa lilo iṣẹ cron ti ara rẹ) lati ṣe idiwọ itẹka igba pipẹ ti awọn faili ti a daabobo.','File Access can also protect files uploaded by FTP or other manual file copy, but does not detect them automatically. Click the button below to scan your uploads folder for files to protect.'=>'Iwọle faili tun le daabobo awọn faili ti a gbe soke nipasẹ FTP tabi awọn ilana ẹda faili miiran, ṣugbọn ko ṣe awari wọn laifọwọyi. Tẹ bọtini ti o wa ni isalẹ lati ṣe iwadii folda awọn uploads rẹ fun awọn faili lati daabobo.','Invalid file filtering key argument.'=>'Ibeere bọtini iyanju faili ti ko tọ.','Please configure File Access options!'=>'Jọwọ ṣe atunto awọn aṣayan Iwọle Faili!','The wp-content folder cannot be relocated outside the main WordPress folder.'=>'Folda wp-content ko le gbe si ita folda akọkọ ti WordPress.','Files linked in post content must be in %1$s (or a subfolder of it). If you move files, consider using a %2$s search and replace plugin%3$s to update those URLs.'=>'Awọn faili ti a so mọ ninu akoonu ifiweranṣẹ gbọdọ wa ni %1$s (tabi folda kekere rẹ). Ti o ba gbe awọn faili, ronu nipa lilo afikun %2$s wiwa ati rọpo%3$s lati ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn URLs wọnyẹn.','File Access can also protect files uploaded by FTP or other manual processes, but does not detect them automatically. This utility can find and protect any uploaded files.'=>'Iwọle faili tun le daabobo awọn faili ti a gbe soke nipasẹ FTP tabi awọn ilana ọwọ miiran, ṣugbọn ko ṣe awari wọn laifọwọyi. Ẹrọ yii le wa ati daabobo eyikeyi awọn faili ti a gbe soke.','To run this utility by cron task or other direct request, use the following URL:'=>'Lati ṣiṣẹ ẹrọ yii nipasẹ iṣẹ cron tabi ibeere taara miiran, lo URL atẹle yii:','To run this utility by direct URL, set a file filtering regen key on Permissions Settings'=>'Lati ṣiṣẹ́ àṣẹ yìí pẹ̀lú URL taara, ṣètò bọtini àtúnṣe àtẹ̀jáde fáìlì lórí Àwọn Eto Ìmúrasílẹ̀','Note: Direct access to uploaded file attachments cannot be filtered because your WP_CONTENT_DIR is not in the WordPress branch.'=>'Àkíyèsí: Àwọn iraye taara sí àwọn fáìlì àfihàn tí a gbe soke kò le ṣe àfihàn nitori WP_CONTENT_DIR rẹ kò wà nínú ẹka WordPress.','The operation was terminated due to an invalid configuration.'=>'Ìṣe náà ti parí nitori àtúnṣe tí kò tọ́.','Checking %s posts / pages...'=>'N ṣàkíyèsí %s ìwé / ìtàn...','%1$s skipping unfilterable file in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s ń fo fáìlì tí kò le ṣe àfihàn nínú %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s','%1$s skipping missing file in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s ń fo fáìlì tí kò sí nínú %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s','%1$sNew attachment in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$sÀfihàn tuntun nínú %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s','%s linked uploads were found in your post / page content.'=>'%s àwọn àtẹ̀jáde tí a so pọ̀ ni a rí nínú akoonu ìwé / ìtàn rẹ.','%s attachment records were added to the database.'=>'%s àwọn àkọọlẹ àfihàn ni a fi kun ìkànsí.','All linked uploads are already registered as attachments.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn àtẹ̀jáde ti a so pọ̀ ti wa ni ìforúkọsílẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn àfihàn.','Statuses enabled here are available as Visibility options for post publishing. Affected posts become inaccessable without a corresponding status-specific role assignment.'=>'Àwọn ipo tí a ti mu ṣiṣẹ́ níbí wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn aṣayan Ìfarahàn fún ìtẹ̀jáde ìwé. Àwọn ìwé tí ó ní ipa di aláìraye láìsí àtúnṣe ipo kan tó bá a mu.','Statuses enabled here are available in the editor as additional steps between Draft and Published.'=>'Àwọn ipo tí a ti mu ṣiṣẹ́ níbí wà nínú olootu gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn ìgbésẹ̀ àfikún láàrín Iwe àkọ́kọ́ àti Iwe tí a tẹ̀jáde.','Statuses alter your content\'s accessibility by imposing additional capability requirements.'=>'Àwọn ipo yí yí padà iraye si akoonu rẹ nípa fifi àwọn ìbéèrè agbara àfikún.','Enable Custom Capabilities by toggling the link below status name. If enabled, non-Editors will need a corresponding %ssupplemental role%s to edit posts of that status.'=>'Mu Awọn Agbara Aṣ customized ṣiṣẹ́ nípa yíyí ìjápọ̀ ní isalẹ orúkọ ipo. Tí a bá mu ṣiṣẹ́, awọn ti kii ṣe Ọlọ́jà yoo nilo ipa %ssupplemental role%s tó bá àtúnṣe àwọn ìwé ti ipo yẹn.','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, %sworkflow is configured%s to make the Publish button increment the post to the next workflow status permitted.'=>'Fun àtúnṣe ìwé nipasẹ olumulo tí kò le tẹ̀jáde, %sworkflow ti ṣètò%s láti jẹ́ kí bọtini Tẹ̀jáde mu ìwé náà pọ si ipo iṣẹ́ ti o tẹle ti a gba laaye.','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, %sworkflow is configured%s to make the Publish button escalate the post to the highest-ordered workflow status permitted.'=>'Fun àtúnṣe ìwé nipasẹ olumulo tí kò le tẹ̀jáde, %sworkflow ti ṣètò%s láti jẹ́ kí bọtini Tẹ̀jáde mu ìwé náà pọ si ipo iṣẹ́ ti o ga julọ ti a gba laaye.','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, the Publish button will escalate the post to the highest-order status permitted to the user.'=>'Fun àtúnṣe ìwé nipasẹ olumulo tí kò le tẹ̀jáde, bọtini Tẹ̀jáde yoo mu ìwé náà pọ si ipo ti o ga julọ ti a gba laaye fun olumulo naa.','Please enable the PublishPress %sStatuses feature%s.'=>'Jọwọ mu ẹya %sStatuses ti PublishPress%s ṣiṣẹ́.','Note that the Post Type itself will also need to have %sPermissions%s enabled.'=>'Ṣe àkíyèsí pé irú Ìwé náà náà yoo nilo láti ni %sPermissions%s ti a mu ṣiṣẹ́.','To disable custom visibility statuses, first re-assign posts to a different status.'=>'Lati pa awọn ipo ìfarahàn aṣa, kọ́kọ́ tún pin àwọn ìwé sí ipo míràn.','Note, this only applies if the role definition includes the pp_moderate_any capability'=>'Ṣe akiyesi, eyi kan wulo ti itumọ ipa ba pẹlu agbara pp_moderate_any','Create or edit custom Privacy or Workflow statuses.'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣatunkọ aṣa Awọn ipo Asiri tabi Iṣakoso.','Create or edit custom Privacy statuses.'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣatunkọ aṣa Awọn ipo Asiri.','Extra Roles created as a type-specific copy of this role will enable assignment of specified custom statuses.'=>'Awọn ipa afikun ti a ṣẹda gẹgẹ bi ẹda pato ti ipa yii yoo gba laaye ipamọ awọn ipo aṣa ti a ṣalaye.','Editors do not need status-specific editing capabilities for workflow posts (Assigned, In Progress, Approved).'=>'Awọn olootu ko nilo awọn agbara ṣiṣatunkọ pato ipo fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ iṣakoso (Ti a yàn, Ni Ilọsiwaju, Ti fọwọsi).','If enabled, non-Editors will need to be granted editing access via the "Permissions" screen.'=>'Ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, awọn ti kii ṣe olootu yoo nilo lati fun ni iraye si ṣiṣatunkọ nipasẹ iboju "Awọn igbanilaaye".','If enabled, a Visibility Status dropdown will appear in Quick Edit for easy status assignment.'=>'Ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, ipo Ifihan dropdown yoo farahan ni Ṣatunkọ Yara fun irọrun ipamọ ipo.','If enabled, this will add Visibility Statuses support to the PublishPress Status plugin.'=>'Ti a ba mu ṣiṣẹ, eyi yoo fi atilẹyin Awọn ipo Ifihan kun si plugin Ipo PublishPress.','Post property or meta field to match with user field'=>'Iwa ifiweranṣẹ tabi aaye meta lati ba aaye olumulo mu','User property or meta field to match with post field'=>'Iwa olumulo tabi aaye meta lati ba aaye ifiweranṣẹ mu','User meta field to match with post field'=>'Aaye meta olumulo lati ba aaye ifiweranṣẹ mu','User role to include in synchronization'=>'Ipa olumulo lati fi kun ni isopọpọ','Parent id for created posts'=>'Idimuu obi fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣẹda','Choose post field from suggested meta key names'=>'Yan aaye ifiweranṣẹ lati awọn orukọ bọtini meta ti a ṣe iṣeduro','When a new user of specified role is added, create or designate a post for them.'=>'Nigbati olumulo tuntun ti ipa ti a sọ tẹlẹ ba ti fi kun, ṣẹda tabi yan ifiweranṣẹ fun wọn.','Create or designate a post for existing users.'=>'Ṣẹda tabi yan ifiweranṣẹ fun awọn olumulo ti o wa tẹlẹ.','This post type is not hierarchical'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii kii ṣe ilana','Automatically create a post for each user in selected roles.'=>'Ṣẹda ifiweranṣẹ laifọwọyi fun ọkọọkan awọn olumulo ni awọn ipa ti a yan.','Hint: If %s have custom fields (like email address), create one to assist field name discovery.'=>'Ikilo: Ti %s ba ni awọn aaye aṣa (gẹgẹ bi adirẹsi imeeli), ṣẹda ọkan lati ṣe iranlọwọ fun awari orukọ aaye.','Enable each user to edit their own User Posts.'=>'Gba gbogbo olumulo laaye lati ṣatunkọ Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ olumulo tiwọn.','Settings for replacing unreadable content with teaser text, provided by the %s module.'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ fun rọ́pò akoonu tí kò le ka pẹ̀lú ìtẹ́sí ọrọ, tí %s module fúnni.','Settings on this tab do not apply because teaser filtering is disabled for all post types.'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ lori taabu yìí kò wulo nítorí ìfọ́kànsí ìtẹ́sí ti wa ni pa fun gbogbo irú ìsọ́sẹ̀.','Since some browsers will cache feeds without regard to user login, block RSS content even for qualified users.'=>'Nítorí pé díẹ̀ nínú àwọn aṣàwákiri yóò fi feeds pamọ́ láìka iroyin olumulo, dènà akoonu RSS àti fún àwọn olumulo tó yẹ.','This feature controls what users will see when trying to view content they are blocked from accessing.'=>'Àmúyẹ yìí n ṣakoso ohun tí àwọn olumulo yóò rí nígbà tí wọn bá ń gbìmọ̀ láti wo akoonu tí wọ́n dènà láti wọlé.','These settings adjust which views, link types and visibility statuses the teaser is applied to.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀tọ́ yìí n ṣe àtúnṣe àwọn àwòrán, irú ìjápọ̀ àti ipo ìfarahàn tí ìtẹ́sí náà fi hàn.','You can override Teaser settings within the Nav Menu by hiding links to unreadable posts that are associated with the terms you select below.'=>'O lè kọ́ ẹ̀tọ́ ìtẹ́sí nínú Àkójọpọ̀ Ìtẹ́sí nípa fífi ìjápọ̀ sílẹ̀ sí àwọn ìsọ́sẹ̀ tí kò le ka tí ó bá jẹ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn ọrọ tí o yan ní isalẹ.','Keep unreadable content hidden in the blogroll and link lists, but show the teaser on direct access attempts.'=>'Pa akoonu tí kò le ka sílẹ̀ nínú blogroll àti àkójọpọ̀ ìjápọ̀, ṣùgbọ́n fi ìtẹ́sí hàn nígbà ìgbìmọ̀ taara.','Hide unreadable private posts, but show a teaser for posts which are unreadable due to regular Privacy or Role Restrictions.'=>'Pa àwọn ìsọ́sẹ̀ ikọ̀kọ́ tí kò le ka sílẹ̀, ṣùgbọ́n fi ìtẹ́sí hàn fún àwọn ìsọ́sẹ̀ tí kò le ka nítorí ìdènà ìpamọ́ tàbí ipa.','If anyone tries to view a post they don\'t have access to, redirect to another post instead of displaying a teaser.'=>'Tí ẹnikẹ́ni bá ń gbìmọ̀ láti wo ìsọ́sẹ̀ tí wọn kò ní wọlé sí, túbọ̀ tọ́ka sí ìsọ́sẹ̀ míràn dipo fífi ìtẹ́sí hàn.','Replace post content or excerpt with custom text, possibly including an inline login form. You can also add text before or after the post title and excerpt.'=>'Rọ́pò akoonu ìsọ́sẹ̀ tàbí àkótán pẹ̀lú ọrọ àdáni, bóyá pẹ̀lú fọọ́mù ìwọlé tààrà. O tún lè fi ọrọ kún ṣáájú tàbí lẹ́yìn akọlé ìsọ́sẹ̀ àti àkótán.','Unreadable items of these comma-separated types will have nav menu item hidden.'=>'Àwọn ohun tí kò le ka ti irú yìí tó pin sí ẹ̀ka pẹ́lú àtọka, yóò ní àkójọpọ̀ ohun tí a pa sílẹ̀.','Visibility Circle membership does not limit viewing access.'=>'Ìfarahàn Circle membership kò dènà ìwòye wọlé.','Editorial Circle membership does not limit editing access.'=>'Ìfarahàn Editorial Circle membership kò dènà ìtúnṣe wọlé.','When searching for users via Permissions ajax, return return only users registered to current site'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ń wá àwọn olumulo nípasẹ̀ Permissions ajax, dáhùn pẹ̀lú àwọn olumulo tó forúkọsílẹ̀ sí ọ̀nà yìí.','If user is a super admin or has \'pp_manage_network_members\' capability, user searches via Permissions ajax return users from all sites'=>'Tí olumulo bá jẹ́ super admin tàbí ní agbára \'pp_manage_network_members\', àwárí olumulo nípasẹ̀ Permissions ajax yóò dáhùn pẹ̀lú àwọn olumulo láti gbogbo ọ̀nà.','Count users as a member of a BuddyPress Permissions Group only if they are a moderator of the BP group'=>'Ka àwọn olumulo gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ BuddyPress Permissions Group nígbà tí wọn bá jẹ́ olùdarí ẹgbẹ́ BP.','Count users as a member of a BuddyPress Permissions Group only if they are an administrator of the BP group'=>'Ka àwọn olumulo gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ BuddyPress Permissions Group nígbà tí wọn bá jẹ́ alákóso ẹgbẹ́ BP.','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for all hierarchical post types) based on user\'s association permissions'=>'CMS Page Tree View plugin: pa àwọn ìjápọ̀ \'fi kún\' sílẹ̀ (fun gbogbo irú ìsọ́sẹ̀ àtẹ̀yìnwá) da lori ìmúlò olumulo.','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for pages) based on user\'s page association permissions'=>'CMS Page Tree View plugin: pa àwọn ìjápọ̀ \'fi kún\' sílẹ̀ (fun àwọn oju-iwe) da lori ìmúlò oju-iwe olumulo.','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for specified hierarchical post type) based on user\'s association permissions'=>'CMS Page Tree View plugin: pa àwọn ìjápọ̀ \'fi kún\' sílẹ̀ (fun irú ìsọ́sẹ̀ àtẹ̀yìnwá tó jẹ́ àfihàn) da lori ìmúlò olumulo.','Prevent Permission from filtering the Nested Pages listing at all'=>'Dènà Ẹ̀tọ́ láti yà àwọn Ìtòlẹ́yìn Àṣẹ àtàwọn ojúewé àtúnṣe kankan','Force Permissions to filter the Nested Pages listing'=>'Force Ẹ̀tọ́ láti yà àwọn Ìtòlẹ́yìn Àṣẹ','Comma-separated list of roles that are allowed to Quick Edit nested pages'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn ipa tí a jẹ́wọ́ láti Ṣàtúnṣe Kíkọ́ àtúnse','Comma-separated list of roles that are allowed to use the Context Menu'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn ipa tí a jẹ́wọ́ láti lo Àtòjọ Akọ́kọ́','Never allow unfiltered users to use the Context Menu, even if they have pp_force_quick_edit capability'=>'Má ṣe jẹ́ kí àwọn olumulo tí kò ní àfihàn lo Àtòjọ Akọ́kọ́, bí ó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé wọn ní agbára pp_force_quick_edit','Disable Add Child link unless user is unfiltered (Administrator or has pp_nested_pages_unfiltered capability)'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Fikun-un Ọmọ àkọ́kọ́, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn (Alákóso tàbí ní agbára pp_nested_pages_unfiltered)','Disable Add Child Page link unless user is unfiltered'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Fikun-un Ojúewé Ọmọ, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn','Disable Insert Page Before link unless user is unfiltered'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Fikun-un Ojúewé Kíkọ́ kí wọn tó, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn','Disable Insert Page After link unless user is unfiltered'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Fikun-un Ojúewé Kíkọ́ lẹ́yìn, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn','Disable Push to Top link unless user is unfiltered'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Dárúkọ sí Giga, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn','Disable Push to Bottom link unless user is unfiltered'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Dárúkọ sí Iṣalẹ̀, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn','Disable Clone link unless user is unfiltered'=>'Dènà ìjápọ̀ Clone, ayafi ti olumulo bá jẹ́ ẹni tí kò ní àfihàn','License'=>'Ìwé àṣẹ','License Key'=>'Bọtini Ìwé àṣẹ','Version'=>'Ẹ̀dá','settings'=>'àwọn iṣètò','Key Expired'=>'Bọtini ti kọja àkókò','Deactivate Key'=>'Dènà Bọtini','Key Activated'=>'Bọtini ti ṣiṣẹ́','(please enter publishpress.com key)'=>'(jọwọ tẹ bọtini publishpress.com)','Activate Key'=>'Ṣí Bọtini','Note: Renewal does not require deactivation. If you do deactivate, re-entry of the license key will be required.'=>'Akoko: Atunṣe ko nilo iṣakoso. Ti o ba ṣe iṣakoso, atunṣe titẹsi ti bọtini iwe-aṣẹ yoo jẹ dandan.','Your license key has expired. For continued priority support, %1$splease renew%2$s.'=>'Bọtini iwe-aṣẹ rẹ ti pari. Fun atilẹyin pataki ti o tẹsiwaju, %1$sjọwọ tunṣe%2$s.','Your license key will expire today. For updates and priority support, %1$splease renew%2$s.'=>'Bọtini iwe-aṣẹ rẹ yoo pari loni. Fun awọn imudojuiwọn ati atilẹyin pataki, %1$sjọwọ tunṣe%2$s.','Your license key (for plugin updates) will expire in %1$d day(s). For updates and priority support, %2$splease renew%3$s.'=>'Bọtini iwe-aṣẹ rẹ (fun awọn imudojuiwọn plugin) yoo pari ni %1$d ọjọ(ọjọ). Fun awọn imudojuiwọn ati atilẹyin pataki, %2$sjọwọ tunṣe%3$s.','For updates to Permissions Pro, activate your %1$sPublishPress license key%2$s.'=>'Fun awọn imudojuiwọn si Permissions Pro, mu bọtini %1$sPublishPress iwe-aṣẹ rẹ%2$s ṣiṣẹ.','reload module info'=>'tun ṣe alaye modulu','Permissions Pro Version: %1$s %2$s'=>'Aṣẹ Pro Version: %1$s %2$s','view %s&nbsp;details'=>'wo %s&nbsp; alaye','update check / install'=>'ṣe imudojuiwọn / fi sori ẹrọ','Database Schema Version: %s'=>'Iru Database Schema: %s','Installation History'=>'Itan Fi sori ẹrọ','%s (previous install)'=>'%s (fi sori ẹrọ ti tẹlẹ)','WordPress Version: %s'=>'Iru WordPress: %s','PHP Version: %s'=>'Iru PHP: %s','The request could not be processed due to a connection failure.'=>'Ibéèrè naa kò lè ṣe xử lý nitori ikuna asopọ.','Please enter the license key shown on your order receipt.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ bọtini iwe-aṣẹ ti o han lori iwe-ẹri aṣẹ rẹ.','An unidentified error occurred.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan ti ko ni idanimọ ṣẹlẹ.','The key has been deactivated.'=>'Bọtini naa ti wa ni pipade.','The key has been activated.'=>'Bọtini naa ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ.','The key has expired.'=>'Bọtini naa ti pari.','The key is invalid.'=>'Bọtini naa ko wulo.','The key could not be activated. Please retry.'=>'Bọtini naa kò lè mu ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ tun gbiyanju.','Circle Membership'=>'Ijọba Circle','Viewing'=>'Wiwo','Editing'=>'Ṣatunkọ','%s is limited to circle authors only, for these post types:'=>'%s ni a fi silẹ fun awọn onkọwe circle nikan, fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ wọnyi:','Circle Activation'=>'Iṣiṣẹ Circle','Visibility Circle'=>'Iwọn Wo Circle','Editorial Circle'=>'Iwọn Iwe-ẹkọ Circle','Users in this group will only be able to view posts that were authored by other users in this group.'=>'Awọn olumulo ninu ẹgbẹ yii nikan ni yoo ni anfani lati wo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a kọ nipasẹ awọn olumulo miiran ninu ẹgbẹ yii.','Users in this group will only be able to edit posts that were authored by other users in this group.'=>'Awọn olumulo ninu ẹgbẹ yii nikan ni yoo ni anfani lati satunkọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a kọ nipasẹ awọn olumulo miiran ninu ẹgbẹ yii.','Normal capability requirements will also be enforced.'=>'Awọn ibeere agbara deede yoo tun ni ipa.','This group is a %s'=>'Ẹgbẹ yii jẹ %s','Circles cannot be enforced on roles with %s capabilities.'=>'A ko le fi awọn iyika mulẹ lori awọn ipa pẹlu %s awọn agbara.','%s%s restrictions%s do not apply to this role. %s'=>'%s%s awọn ihamọ%s ko wulo fun ipa yii. %s','Apply limitation for post types:'=>'Lo ihamọ fun awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ:','Users may be excused from Circle restrictions by adding the %1$s or %2$s capability to their role.'=>'Awọn olumulo le gba aṣẹ lati awọn ihamọ Circle nipa fifi %1$s tabi %2$s agbara si ipa wọn.','Circle Type'=>'Iru Circle','Visibility'=>'Ihan','Editorial'=>'Iwe iroyin','Access Circle restrictions apply to revisions'=>'Awọn ihamọ iraye si Circle wulo fun awọn atunṣe','Create Topics in'=>'Ṣẹda Awọn akọle ni','Topic Creation'=>'Ṣẹda Akọle','Create Topic'=>'Ṣẹda Akọle','Submit Replies in'=>'Fi Awọn esi silẹ ni','Reply Submission'=>'Fifisilẹ Esi','Submit Reply'=>'Fi Esi silẹ','Show more details'=>'Fihan alaye diẹ sii','BuddyPress Group'=>'Ẹgbẹ BuddyPress','BP Permission Group'=>'Ẹgbẹ Aṣẹ BP','BP Permission Groups'=>'Awọn Ẹgbẹ Aṣẹ BP','Manage'=>'Ṣakoso','BuddyPress Groups'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ BuddyPress','Page creation was blocked because you are not allowed to select that parent page.'=>'Ìdàgbàsókè àkópọ̀ ti di àfiyèsí nítorí pé a kò gba ọ laaye láti yan ìtòsọ́nà yẹn.','Back to Dashboard'=>'Padà sí Ibi ìṣàkóso','Permission Denied'=>'Ìfọwọ́lé Kò Gba','You are not allowed to select that parent page.'=>'A kò gba ọ laaye láti yan ìtòsọ́nà yẹn.','Network Groups'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ Nẹ́tìwọ́kì','Network Group'=>'Ẹgbẹ Nẹ́tìwọ́kì','Teaser text'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ àfihàn','Network'=>'Nẹ́tìwọ́kì','Groups'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ','Forum Teaser'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ àfihàn Forum','Network-wide groups'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ gbogbo Nẹ́tìwọ́kì','Teaser Topics'=>'Àwọn Kókó àfihàn','Hide Topic / Reply Author Link'=>'Pa Kókó / Ẹlẹ́da Ìbáṣepọ̀ Kọ́ńkú','Compatibility Pack'=>'Àkópọ̀ Iṣọkan','Topic Teaser Text (%s):'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ Kókó àfihàn (%s):','Reply Teaser Text (%s):'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ Ìbáṣepọ̀ àfihàn (%s):','First Reply'=>'Ìbáṣepọ̀ Kíní','Other Replies'=>'Àwọn Ìbáṣepọ̀ Míràn','Not Logged In'=>'Kò Wà Nínú','Logged In Users'=>'Awọn olumulo Ti o Wọle','Insert a login form by using %s[login_form]%s shortcode.'=>'Fi fọọmu wọle kan sinu nipa lilo %s[login_form]%s shortcode.','Hide Topics and Replies'=>'Tọju Awọn Koko-ọrọ ati Awọn Idahun','Tease Topics and Replies'=>'Fa Awọn Koko-ọrọ ati Awọn Idahun','Show Topics, Tease Replies'=>'Fihan Awọn Koko-ọrọ, Fa Awọn Idahun','The single forum teaser may be customized by STYLESHEETPATH/press-permit/teaser-content-forum.php'=>'Teaser forum kan le jẹ adani nipasẹ STYLESHEETPATH/press-permit/teaser-content-forum.php','[This topic requires additional permissions or membership.]'=>'[Koko-ọrọ yii nilo awọn igbanilaaye afikun tabi ọmọ ẹgbẹ.]','[...]'=>'[...]','[This topic requires site login.]'=>'[Koko-ọrọ yii nilo wọle si aaye.]','[login required]'=>'[wọle yẹ]','[This reply requires site login.]'=>'[Idahun yii nilo wọle si aaye.]','File Access'=>'Iwọle Faili','File Access Reset Key:'=>'Bọtini Atunṣe Iwọle Faili:','Small Thumbnails Unfiltered'=>'Awọn Thumbnail Kekere Ti a Ko Filter','Make Unattached Files Private'=>'Ṣe Awọn Faili Ti a Ko So pọ Di Ikọkọ','Make Attached Files Private'=>'Ṣe Awọn Faili Ti a So pọ Di Ikọkọ','%1$sNote%2$s: Direct access to uploaded file attachments cannot be filtered because mod_rewrite is not enabled on your server.'=>'%1$sAkíyèsi%2$s: Iwọle taara si awọn asomọ faili ti a gbe sori ẹrọ ko le jẹ filti nitori mod_rewrite ko ni mu ṣiṣẹ lori olupin rẹ.','%1$sNote%2$s: Direct access to uploaded file attachments will not be filtered due to your nonstandard UPLOADS path.'=>'%1$sAkíyèsi%2$s: Iwọle taara si awọn asomọ faili ti a gbe sori ẹrọ kii yoo jẹ filti nitori ọna UPLOADS ti ko ni boṣewa rẹ.','%1$sNote%2$s: Direct access to uploaded file attachments cannot be filtered because WordPress permalinks are set to default.'=>'%1$sAkíyèsi%2$s: Iwọle taara si awọn asomọ faili ti a gbe sori ẹrọ ko le jẹ filti nitori pe awọn permalinks WordPress ti ṣeto si aiyipada.','show required rules'=>'fihan awọn ofin to nilo','Copy'=>'Daakọ','Copied!'=>'Ti daakọ!','Regenerate Access File'=>'Tun ṣe faili wiwọle','Attachments Utility'=>'Iṣẹ afikun','For Nginx integration, see %spublishpress.com documentation%s.'=>'Fun isopọ Nginx, wo %spublishpress.com iwe-ẹkọ%s.','Back to Permissions Settings'=>'Padà si Eto Aṣẹ','File Access for Files Uploaded via FTP'=>'Wiwọle faili fun awọn faili ti a gbe silẹ nipasẹ FTP','Find Files Uploaded via FTP'=>'Wa awọn faili ti a gbe silẹ nipasẹ FTP','The network attachment scan has been queued and will continue in the background via WP-Cron.'=>'Ibi ti a ti n ṣayẹwo asopọ nẹtiwọọki ti wa ni aṣẹ ati pe yoo tẹsiwaju ni abẹlẹ nipasẹ WP-Cron.','A network attachment scan is already in progress or could not be scheduled.'=>'A ti n ṣayẹwo asopọ nẹtiwọọki tẹlẹ tabi ko le ṣe eto.','Site Configuration Requirements'=>'Awọn ibeere isọdi aaye','For proper access control of direct file URLs, your site must meet these requirements:'=>'Fun iṣakoso wiwọle to tọ ti awọn URL faili taara, aaye rẹ gbọdọ pade awọn ibeere wọnyi:','Automated Processing'=>'Iṣakoso adaṣe','Utility Endpoint URL:'=>'URL ipari iṣẹ:','Copy URL'=>'Daakọ URL','Go to Settings'=>'Lọ si Eto','RUNNING'=>'NṢIṢE','Operation complete'=>'Iṣe ti pari','Scan Again'=>'Ṣayẹwo lẹẹkansi','%1$s (%2$s - %3$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s - %3$s)','Role selection is required for %s. Please select at least one role.'=>'Yiyan ipa jẹ dandan fun %s. Jọwọ yan ipa kan least.','You seem to be using a Team / Staff plugin. To synchronize posts to users and give them editing permission, go to %1$sPermissions > Settings > Sync Posts%2$s'=>'O dabi pe o n lo afikun Ẹgbẹ / Ọmọ ẹgbẹ. Lati ṣepọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ si awọn olumulo ki o fun wọn ni aṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ, lọ si %1$sAṣẹ > Eto > Ṣepọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ%2$s','User Posts'=>'Àwọn Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Synchronize Posts'=>'Ṣe Àtúnṣe Àwọn Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Create Posts for Users'=>'Ṣẹda Àwọn Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso fún Àwọn Olumulo','Grant Author Permissions'=>'Fúnni ni Àṣẹ Onkọwe','Post Types'=>'Iru Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Match Post Field'=>'Ba Aaye Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso mu','Match User Field'=>'Ba Aaye Olumulo mu','User Role'=>'Ìpò Olumulo','Parent Post'=>'Ìkọ̀kọ́ Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Quantity'=>'Iye','Post Status'=>'Ipo Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Post Title'=>'Àkọlé Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Post slug'=>'Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso slug','User Display Name'=>'Orúkọ Ifihan Olumulo','User email'=>'Imeeli Olumulo','User login'=>'Ìwọlé Olumulo','User nicename'=>'Orúkọ Aláwọsánmọ̀ Olumulo','User Posts Created:'=>'Àwọn Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso Olumulo Ti Ṣẹda:','Post Type'=>'Iru Ọrọ Ìṣàkóso','Select where posts will be created for users.'=>'Yan ibikibi ti a ti ṣẹda awọn ọrọ ìṣàkóso fún àwọn olumulo.','New Users'=>'Awọn olumulo Tuntun','Create posts for new users.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ifiweranṣẹ fun awọn olumulo tuntun.','Current Users'=>'Awọn olumulo lọwọlọwọ','Create posts for existing users.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ifiweranṣẹ fun awọn olumulo to wa tẹlẹ.','Role'=>'Iṣẹ','Create posts for users in these roles.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ifiweranṣẹ fun awọn olumulo ni awọn iṣẹ wọnyi.','Set the number of posts to create for each user.'=>'Ṣeto nọmba awọn ifiweranṣẹ lati ṣẹda fun ọkọọkan olumulo.','Status'=>'Ipo','Set the status for created posts.'=>'Ṣeto ipo fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣẹda.','No post types are 